  unitName: Wargloon
  unitId: 30662
  unitNumber: 1163
  description: An insect native to Ishgria. It grows more vicious and agile in maturity,
    making it more dangerous, but the increase in its powers of perception is even
    more marked. The Summoners' Hall urges caution regarding surprise attacks from
    this insect in particular when entering Ishgria's forests. Owing to its appearance,
    research is underway regarding connections between this insect and the Valmodora
    variety that has been sighted in Grand Gaia. However, no clear commonalities
    have been discovered at this time.
